#. module: vehicle_rental
#: model:mail.template,body_html:vehicle_rental.vehicle_rental_booking_mail_template
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"                    </p><h4>\n"
"                        Dear\n"
"                        <strong>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.customer_id.name\"/>\n"
"                        </strong>,\n"
"                    </h4>\n"
"                \n"
"                <hr/>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    We are excited about your upcoming journey with us and want to ensure that you have all the\n"
"                    necessary information regarding the rental contract.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <table>\n"
"                    <tr>\n"
"                        <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center; width: 100%\">\n"
"                            <strong>\n"
"                                Please review the following details:\n"
"                            </strong>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                    <tr>\n"
"                        <td style=\"width: 50%\">\n"
"                            <strong>\n"
"                                Reference Number:\n"
"                            </strong>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td style=\"width: 50%\">\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.reference_no\"/>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                    <tr>\n"
"                        <td style=\"width: 50%\">\n"
"                            <strong>\n"
"                                Vehicle:\n"
"                            </strong>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td style=\"width: 50%\">\n"
"                            <t t-if=\"object.vehicle_id.name\">\n"
"                                <t t-out=\"object.vehicle_id.name\"/>\n"
"                            </t>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                    <tr>\n"
"                        <td style=\"width: 50%\">\n"
"                            <strong>\n"
"                                Pick-Up Date:\n"
"                            </strong>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td style=\"width: 50%\">\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.start_date\"/>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                    <tr>\n"
"                        <td style=\"width: 50%\">\n"
"                            <strong>\n"
"                                Pick-Up Location:\n"
"                            </strong>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td style=\"width: 50%\">\n"
"                            <t t-if=\"object.pick_up_street\">\n"
"                                <t t-out=\"object.pick_up_street\"/>\n"
"                            </t>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                    <tr t-if=\"object.pick_up_street2\">\n"
"                        <td style=\"width: 50%\">\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td style=\"width: 50%\">\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.pick_up_street2\"/>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                    <tr>\n"
"                        <td style=\"width: 50%\">\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td style=\"width: 50%\">\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.pick_up_city\" class=\"me-1\"/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.pick_up_state_id.name\" class=\"me-1\"/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.pick_up_zip\"/>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                    <tr t-if=\"object.pick_up_country_id.name\">\n"
"                        <td style=\"width: 50%\">\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td style=\"width: 50%\">\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.pick_up_country_id.name\"/>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                    <tr>\n"
"                        <td style=\"width: 50%\">\n"
"                            <strong>\n"
"                                Drop-Off Date:\n"
"                            </strong>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td style=\"width: 50%\">\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.end_date\"/>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                    <tr>\n"
"                        <td style=\"width: 50%\">\n"
"                            <strong>\n"
"                                Drop-Off Location:\n"
"                            </strong>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td style=\"width: 50%\">\n"
"                            <t t-if=\"object.drop_off_street\">\n"
"                                <t t-out=\"object.drop_off_street\"/>\n"
"                            </t>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                    <tr t-if=\"object.drop_off_street2\">\n"
"                        <td style=\"width: 50%\">\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td style=\"width: 50%\">\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.drop_off_street2\"/>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                    <tr>\n"
"                        <td style=\"width: 50%\">\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td style=\"width: 50%\">\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.drop_off_city\" class=\"me-1\"/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.drop_off_state_id.name\" class=\"me-1\"/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.drop_off_zip\"/>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                    <tr t-if=\"object.drop_off_country_id.name\">\n"
"                        <td style=\"width: 50%\">\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td style=\"width: 50%\">\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.drop_off_country_id.name\"/>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                </table>\n"
"                <hr/>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Before your journey, please familiarize yourself with the rental agreement, which outlines the terms\n"
"                    and conditions. To access the agreement, visit\n"
"                    <strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.company_id.website\"/>\n"
"                    </strong>\n"
"                    or contact our customer support team. Ensure that your insurance coverage is adequate and that all\n"
"                    drivers meet the requirements. A security deposit may be required at pickup, refundable upon the\n"
"                    vehicle's return. Conduct a thorough inspection before your journey, noting any pre-existing\n"
"                    damages. For any questions or concerns, reach out to our customer support team at\n"
"                    <strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.company_id.phone\"/>\n"
"                    </strong>\n"
"                    We appreciate your trust and wish you a fantastic journey!\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <h5>\n"
"                    Best regards,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.responsible_id.name\"/>\n"
"                    </strong>\n"
"                </h5>\n"
"                <hr/>\n"
"                <span>\n"
"                    <h4>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                    </h4>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.company_id.phone\"/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.company_id.email\"/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.company_id.website\"/>\n"
"                </span>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<table style=\"width: 100%\">\n"
"                    <tr>\n"
"                        <td>\n"
"                            Estimada cliente,\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            <h4>\n"
"                                <strong>\n"
"                                    <t t-out=\"object.customer_id.name\"/>\n"
"                                </strong>\n"
"                            </h4>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                </table>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Estamos entusiasmados con su próximo viaje con nosotros y queremos asegurarnos de que tenga toda la\n"
"                   información necesaria sobre el contrato de alquiler.\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <hr/>\n"
"                <table>\n"
"                    <tr>\n"
"                        <td>\n"
"                            <strong>\n"
"                                Por favor revise los siguientes detalles:\n"
"                            </strong>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                    <tr>\n"
"                        <td>\n"
"                            <strong>\n"
"                              Número de referencia:\n"
"                            </strong>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.reference_no\"/>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                    <tr>\n"
"                        <td>\n"
"                            <strong>\n"
"                              Vehículo:\n"
"                            </strong>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.vehicle_id.name\"/>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                    <tr>\n"
"                        <td>\n"
"                            <strong>\n"
"                                Fecha de recogida:\n"
"                            </strong>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.start_date\"/>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                    <tr>\n"
"                        <td>\n"
"                            <strong>\n"
"                                Lugar de recogida:\n"
"                            </strong>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.pick_up_street\"/> , \n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                    <tr>\n"
"                        <td>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.pick_up_street2\"/> , \n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                    <tr>\n"
"                        <td>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.pick_up_city\"/> , \n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.pick_up_state_id.name\"/> , \n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.pick_up_zip\"/>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                    <tr>\n"
"                        <td>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.pick_up_country_id.name\"/>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"\n"
"                    <tr>\n"
"                        <td>\n"
"                            <strong>\n"
"                                Fecha de entrega:\n"
"                            </strong>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.end_date\"/>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                    <tr>\n"
"                        <td>\n"
"                            <strong>\n"
"                                Punto de entrega:\n"
"                            </strong>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.drop_off_street\"/> , \n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                    <tr>\n"
"                        <td>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.drop_off_street2\"/> , \n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                    <tr>\n"
"                        <td>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.drop_off_city\"/> , \n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.drop_off_state_id.name\"/> , \n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.drop_off_zip\"/>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                    <tr>\n"
"                        <td>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                        <td>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.drop_off_country_id.name\"/>\n"
"                        </td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                </table>\n"
"                <hr/>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    Antes de su viaje, familiarícese con el contrato de alquiler, que describe los términos\n"
"                   Y condiciones. Para acceder al acuerdo, visite\n"
"                    <strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.company_id.website\"/>\n"
"                    </strong>\n"
"                  o póngase en contacto con nuestro equipo de atención al cliente. Asegúrese de que la cobertura de su seguro sea adecuada y de que todos\n"
"                    Los conductores cumplen con los requisitos. Es posible que se requiera un depósito de seguridad al momento de la recogida, reembolsable al\n"
"                    devolución del vehículo. Realice una inspección minuciosa antes de su viaje, tomando nota de cualquier\n"
"                    daños y perjuicios. Si tiene alguna pregunta o inquietud, comuníquese con nuestro equipo de atención al cliente en\n"
"                    <strong>\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"object.company_id.phone\"/>\n"
"                    </strong>\n"
"                    ¡Agradecemos su confianza y le deseamos un viaje fantástico!\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <h6>\n"
"                   Atentamente,\n"
"                </h6>\n"
"                <h5>\n"
